  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "食品科學與永續環境",
    "sub_ename": "FOOD SCIENCE AND SUSTAINABLE ENVIRONMENT",
    "describe_ch": "歐盟推動「從農場到餐桌策略」，目的在建立公平、健康與友善環境的糧食體系，策略目標包括減少化學農藥及抗生素使用、減少過度施肥、提倡有機農業、增進動物福利以及維持生物多樣性等。本課程帶領學生了解食品科學與永續環境之關係，認識食物貧窮、健康飲食、食品添加劑、基改食品等議題，並討論如何以創新的科技與社會設計解決食物浪費問題。最後，由學生設計食品科學活動，體驗食品科學與永續環境之精神。",
    "describe_eh": "EU promotes the \"Farm to Fork Strategy\", which aims to build a fair, healthy and environmentally friendly food system. The strategic goals include reducing the use of chemical pesticides and antibiotics, reducing over-fertilization, promoting organic agriculture, improving animal welfare, and maintaining biodiversity. This course leads students to speculate on how human beings will choose food to ingest nutrient sources in the future and understand the relationship between food science and sustainable environment, to understand the issues of food poverty, healthy diet, food additives, genetically modified food, etc., and to discuss how to solve the problem of food waste through innovative technology and social design. Finally, students design food science activities to experience the spirit of food science and sustainable environment.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "因應氣候變遷與永續發展，思辨土地、人類與食物的關係",
      "describe_en": "Reflecting on the relationship between land, human beings and food in response to climate change and sustainable development"
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "設計食品科學與永續環境教育活動，體現永續農業精神",
      "describe_en": "Designing food science and sustainable environmental education activities to reflect the spirit of permaculture"
    }
  ],
